# §18.5 raw generation dumps (results/gen_18_5*.json, results/spotcheck_18_5.json).
# These are the ablated model's actual completions to held-out harmful prompts --
# i.e. a ready-made corpus of harmful content produced by a model with its refusal
# behaviour removed. `origin` is public. The scientific content is fully carried by
# the aggregate statistics already committed (refusal rates, CE, distinct-token
# ratios, mean lengths in §18.21/§18.23), and the completions regenerate from
# scripts/stageb_18_5.py for anyone with the model and a GPU. They are retained on
# the compute box only, deliberately.
results/gen_18_5*.json
results/spotcheck_18_5.json
